# portal 1.03 patch 20d — the server list never empties during a switch
#
# Switching modes empties both sources for a moment: the engine has no groups until it takes
# the profile, and the child has no servers until its subscription is read. The screen drew
# that as an empty list. The list now keeps the last non-empty group it drew — a name, a
# protocol and a ping, all still true — and only a non-empty answer from the new owner
# replaces it; before anything has answered, the profile's own `proxies:` are the rows. A
# profile with no proxies at all still ends in the honest empty state.
